402
00:19:55,547 --> 00:19:58,421
<font color="#FFFFFF">K-I-S-S.</font>

403
00:19:58,422 --> 00:20:00,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, you spelled, "sacrikiss"</font>

404
00:20:00,921 --> 00:20:03,170
<font color="#FFFFFF">while gazing into
that boy's eyes.</font>

405
00:20:03,171 --> 00:20:04,296
<font color="#FFFFFF">What are you doing?</font>

406
00:20:04,297 --> 00:20:06,129
<font color="#FFFFFF">I heard what you said
to your mom.</font>

407
00:20:06,130 --> 00:20:07,713
<font color="#FFFFFF">You deserve to win.</font>

408
00:20:07,714 --> 00:20:09,462
<font color="#FFFFFF">Steve, spell…</font>

409
00:20:09,463 --> 00:20:10,448
<font color="#FFFFFF">"medicine."</font>

410
00:20:10,463 --> 00:20:11,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Medicine.</font>

411
00:20:11,921 --> 00:20:14,337
<font color="#FFFFFF">M-E-D…</font>

412
00:20:14,338 --> 00:20:19,504
<font color="#FFFFFF">E-A-S-F-A-M-I-L-Y-
R-E-U-N-I-O-N.</font>

413
00:20:19,505 --> 00:20:22,337
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, that is
obviously incorrect</font>

414
00:20:22,338 --> 00:20:25,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">because you spelled
"Medea's Family Reunion."</font>

415
00:20:28,921 --> 00:20:31,045
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay Steve, the word was "dog,"</font>

416
00:20:31,046 --> 00:20:32,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you spelled the entire</font>

417
00:20:32,921 --> 00:20:35,713
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Arrested Development</i> song,
"Mr. Wendell."</font>

418
00:20:35,714 --> 00:20:38,838
<font color="#FFFFFF">So… on to Akiko.</font>

419
00:20:38,839 --> 00:20:42,337
<font color="#FFFFFF">Akiko, your word is "A."</font>

420
00:20:42,338 --> 00:20:43,323
<font color="#FFFFFF">Seven.</font>

421
00:20:43,338 --> 00:20:44,962
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, that was a number.</font>

422
00:20:44,963 --> 00:20:46,629
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's becoming very clear to me</font>

423
00:20:46,630 --> 00:20:48,254
<font color="#FFFFFF">that I won't be making
my date tonight.</font>

424
00:20:48,255 --> 00:20:52,004
<font color="#FFFFFF">We recently started having sex,
